#
# An asset derived from a vgstation13 sprite:
#
#   path: zas-atmos/src/main/resources/assets/zas_atmos/textures/block/canister.png
#   origin: vgstation13
#   source: icons/obj/atmos.dmi
#   state: yellow
#   commit: 0123456789ab
#
#   source       the .dmi file, as a path in the vgstation13 repository.
#                List several separated by ", " when an asset draws on more
#                than one. Never a file under goon/ (CC BY-NC-SA, NFR-041).
#   state        the icon state used. List several separated by ", ".
#   commit       the vgstation13 commit hash, 7 to 40 hex digits.
#   attribution  optional; defaults to "vgstation13 contributors, CC BY-SA 3.0 US".
#
# An asset taken or adapted from any other source:
#
#   path: zas-atmos/src/main/resources/assets/zas_atmos/sounds/hiss.ogg
#   origin: other
#   source: https://example.org/sounds/hiss
#   license: CC-BY-4.0
#   attribution: Jane Doe
#
#   source       where it came from: a URL, or a description if there is none.
#   license      its SPDX license id. Allowed, because they can be adapted
