#   attribution  the author to credit, as the license asks. Required except
#                for CC0-1.0.
#
# Any entry may add "author: <name>" (who made or adapted the file for ZAS³)
# and "notes: <text>". If an asset's origin or license is unclear, leave it
# out.
#
